{"id":"u-ba31e70e-021d-4813-a701-31a1916afecd","src":"community","title":"Ludi’s In-season split","author":"Anonymous","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/I8lPEX-in-season-split-1","desc":"I'm an amateur 7 a side footballer and I created this program modifying the Cody Lefever's famous GCZLP structure that I use during off-season to build strenght and hypertrophy. I created this program for me and it's not meant to be followed as one created by professionals, this is purely amateur stuff and I don't have any type of certification in this field. This is a 2+1 day split built for my personal needs during the season when I have two field trainings and a game in the weekend. The days A1 and B1 are high intensity days meant to progress squat or hinge movements, you will need at least one rest day after to recover for the field training, the load progressions can be copied from the GCZLP structure and according to your needs. C days are for cardio zone 2 and core strenght. A2 and B2 are meant to be MD-1 low intensity trainings, here the objective is to prepare the body for the game the day after without accumulating fatigue and doms: for this reason the lower body exercises are meant to be used wisely with very small weights and 2-3 RIR at the end of each set. \nIf you have any tips or want to connect feel free to modify this programs tailoring it to your needs. Enjoy and push! Stay safe.","level":["Beginner","Novice","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-12T14:16:04.503Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["A1","C","B2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Cossack Squat","sets":[{"r":5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"x":5}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"r":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Calf Raise (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Cardio (Z